<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>LLM Usage</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The use of large language models in this study was strictly limited to improving grammar and readability. All aspects of the research including ideation, methodological design, data analysis, and interpretation were conducted solely by the authors.</p>
</div>
</section>
